.TH GPFSDF 1 "2026-07-28" "gpfsug-tools" "GPFS/Spectrum Scale Usergroup Tools"
.SH NAME
gpfsdf \- summarise per-fileset quota and usage on a Spectrum Scale filesystem
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gpfsdf
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gpfsdf
prints a table of independent filesets together with their path, quota,
current usage and file count, followed by a totals line. It combines the
per-fileset quota figures reported by
.BR mmrepquota (8)
with the fileset paths reported by
.BR mmlsfileset (8).
.PP
Quota and usage are shown in gibibytes (GiB). The script takes no options; the
target filesystem is currently hard-coded to
.BR NOC .
.SH REQUIREMENTS
.B gpfsdf
requires Python 3. It invokes
.I /usr/lpp/mmfs/bin/mmrepquota
and
.I /usr/lpp/mmfs/bin/mmlsfileset
directly (no shell), so it must run on a node where those commands are
available and the caller is permitted to run them.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B non-zero
.BR mmrepquota (8)
or
.BR mmlsfileset (8)
failed, or their output could not be parsed. Earlier versions printed an empty
table in this situation; the command now fails loudly instead.
.SH EXAMPLE
.RS
.EX
$ gpfsdf

Path                                   Fileset          Quota(Gb)  Used(Gb)     Files

/noc/alpha                             alpha                    1     0.500       250
/noc/projA                             projA                    2     1.000       500

Total                                                           3     1.500       750
.EE
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lpp/mmfs/bin/mmrepquota
Reports per-fileset block and file usage against quotas.
.TP
.I /usr/lpp/mmfs/bin/mmlsfileset
Reports fileset names and their linked paths.
.SH BUGS
The filesystem name is hard-coded to
.BR NOC ;
edit the script to target a different filesystem.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mmrepquota (8),
.BR mmlsfileset (8)
